  "content": {
    "title": "吉林省2015年下半年全国计算机应用技术证书考试（NIT）全部结束",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2015-12-24",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <div class=\"mainlist bor\">\n            <h5>\n                <div class=\"ttt text20\">\n                    就业动态</div>\n            </h5>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"titles\">\n                    <span id=\"lblTitle\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><b><font size=\"5\">吉林省2015年下半年全国计算机应用技术证书考试（NIT）全部结束</font></b></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"Issues\">\n                    <span id=\"lblIssue\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><font size=\"3\">发布部门:信息管理部   发布时间:2015-12-24 15:42:59</font></span>\n                </div>\n               <div id=\"tdNewsContent\"><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体,SimSun; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2015年12月5日至12月23日，吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心组织实施了下半年全国计算机应用技术证书考试（NIT）吉林省考区考试工作。本次考试省内有17个考点开考，共计211场次，参考考生10259人次，较去年同期增加3120人次，增幅达43.7%。全年报考16330 人次，较去年增加4820人次，增幅达41.87%。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"IMG_20151212_103756.jpg\" src=\"http://www.jilinjobs.cn//Common/GetFileByServer.aspx?FileName=6358656866806250003926518.jpg\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"_MG_2506.JPG\" src=\"migration-resource://32aa1d7c713019327f5116d55eeecfd4b8c8b923ad6b66d0d9e274eecc0f43a9\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"_MG_2524.JPG\" src=\"migration-resource://06cd3ef6357798477d5b310b19474cf64d8315ee29015e7eb849dcb11ef3aad8\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"_MG_2526.JPG\" src=\"migration-resource://f95d078b8e025b43d45ae666fd9b8119463a64b85e40492ecd099c101769c348\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"_MG_2536.JPG\" src=\"migration-resource://9db02ff58279fc0eb1e56ece007e9262fc6ac983b60d19979c4f4c245496dff3\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"20151212_084358.jpg\" src=\"migration-resource://a4538ada0e2db398048730aa92749ede7616b9f064f04cf27cadbb019c4ca5d0\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"IMG_2488.JPG\" src=\"migration-resource://2c62b15db93b9836bb64939a17b4cf0521f67141ff2e05e830cdd07457f02db4\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"IMG_2543.JPG\" src=\"migration-resource://93c21ea52a93b28c59c2ac509c738ce924d32459b85003acc0b51b2fb592f75a\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"IMG_2545.JPG\" src=\"migration-resource://034e6c28551486c4915c85c8b96406e794a0432d399ceeea914096fa359a391d\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img title=\"IMG_4860.JPG\" src=\"migration-resource://24319371d58403da4d387d094b95ecc25299b20cc775087b528db1ef8ee8d0f7\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体,SimSun; font-size: 18px;\"></span></p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"xian2\">\n            </div>\n            <table width=\"100%\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td width=\"10%\" height=\"23\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"right\">\n                        附件：\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                    <td width=\"90%\" height=\"23\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n                        \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody></table>\n        </div>\n                    ",
